 "when_to_recite_en": "Recite for your loved ones when you cannot help them in any other way.", "category_hierarchy": {"intent": "seeking_clarity", "primary": "Guidance", "secondary": "Direction"}, "recommendation_tags": ["after_salah", "before_decision", "daily_recitation", "seeking_clarity"], "recommended_moments": ["after_salah", "before_decision", "during_confusion"], "normalized_surah_names": ["An-Nas", "\u0627\u0644\u0646\u0627\u0633"]}'::jsonb, 'published', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, TRUE, '56f216af-a404-48b5-a081-66a30de79989', '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', 'Al-lazī yuwas wisu fī sudūrin nās', 'अल लज़ी युवस विसु फ़ी सुदूरिन नास', 'ٱلَّذِى يُوَسْوِسُ فِى صُدُورِ ٱلنَّاسِ', 'dua-for-protection-surah-an-naas-114-5', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('0eec2b3c-2468-490b-b5fa-b190e82ea048', 'dua', 'নিঃস্বার্থ দানের প্রতিদানের আয়াত', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ (2:262)', 'Verse on Charity Without Reminder or Injury', 'आख़िरत में कामयाबी की दुआ', 'آخرت کی کامیابی کی دعا', 'যারা স্বীয় ধন সম্পদ আল্লাহর রাস্তায় ব্যয় করে, এরপর ব্যয় করার পর সে অনুগ্রহের কথা প্রকাশ করে না এবং কষ্টও দেয় না, তাদেরই জন্যে তাদের পালনকর্তার কাছে রয়েছে পুরস্কার এবং তাদের কোন আশংকা নেই, তারা চিন্তিতও হবে না।', 'ٱلَّذِينَ يُنفِقُونَ أَمْوَٰلَهُمْ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ثُمَّ لَا يُتْبِعُونَ مَآ أَنفَقُوا۟ مَنًّۭا وَلَآ أَذًۭى ۙ لَّهُمْ أَجْرُهُمْ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ وَلَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا هُمْ يَحْزَنُونَ', 'They who spend their possessions for the sake of God and do not thereafter mar their spending by stressing their own benevolence and hurting [the feelings of the needy] shall have their reward with ''their Sustainer, and no fear need they have, and neither shall they grieve.', NULL, NULL, 'আল্লাযীনা ইয়ুনফিকূনা আমওয়ালাহুম ফী সাবীলিল্লাহি সুম্মা লা ইয়ুতবি''ঊনা মা আনফাকূ মান্নাও ওয়ালা আযাল্লাহুম আজরুহুম ইনদা রাব্বিহিম ওয়ালা খাওফুন আলাইহিম ওয়ালা হুম ইয়াহযানূন', 'Hereafter', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is hereafter, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, night reflection and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for success in the Hereafter | Surah Al-Baqara 2:262", "search_intent": ["akhirah", "judgment_day", "paradise"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-guidance-surah-al-baqara-2-262", "focus_keywords": ["dua for success in the hereafter", "quranic dua for hereafter", "surah al-baqara 2:262"], "difficulty_level": "long", "meta_description": "Dua for success in the Hereafter from Surah Al-Baqara 2:262. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["hereafter", "akhirah", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u09b6\u09c7\u09b7 \u09aa\u09b0\u09bf\u09a3\u09a4\u09bf \u09a8\u09bf\u09df\u09c7 \u09ad\u09c7\u09a4\u09b0\u09c7 \u099f\u09be\u09a8\u09be\u09aa\u09cb\u09dc\u09c7\u09a8 \u09a5\u09be\u0995\u09b2\u09c7 \u0986\u0996\u09bf\u09b0\u09be\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ab\u09b2\u09a4\u09be\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be \u09a5\u09c7\u0995\u09c7 \u09b6\u0995\u09cd\u09a4\u09bf \u09ae\u09c7\u09b2\u09c7\u0964", "social": {"short": "\u09a8\u09bf\u099c\u09c7\u0995\u09c7 \u0986\u09b2\u09cd\u09b2\u09be\u09b9\u09b0 \u09b9\u09be\u09a4\u09c7 \u09b8\u0981\u09aa\u09c7 \u09a6\u09c7\u0993\u09df\u09be\u09b0 \u09ae\u09c1\u09b9\u09c2\u09b0\u09cd\u09a4 \u2022 2:262", "facebook": "\u0986\u0996\u09bf\u09b0\u09be\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ab\u09b2\u09a4\u09be\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be (Surah Al-Baqara 2:262) \u2014 \u0986\u09ae\u09b2 \u099b\u09cb\u099f, \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09ad\u09be\u09ac \u09ac\u09dc\u2014\u098f\u0987 \u09a7\u09b0\u09a8\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09df\u09be\u0964", "whatsapp": "\u0986\u0996\u09bf\u09b0\u09be\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ab\u09b2\u09a4\u09be\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be (Surah Al-Baqara 2:262). \u099a\u09be\u0987\u09b2\u09c7 \u09a8\u09be\u09ae\u09be\u099c\u09c7\u09b0 \u09aa\u09b0 \u09aa\u09dc\u09a4\u09c7 \u09aa\u09be\u09b0\u09c7\u09a8\u0964"}, "source": "Quran", "virtue": "Dua relieves burden by turning the heart fully to Allah.", "emotion": ["peace", "hope", "resilience"], "benefits": ["\u09a6\u09c1\u09b6\u09cd\u099a\u09bf\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09be\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ae\u09df\u09c7 \u0995\u09a5\u09be\u0997\u09c1\u09b2\u09cb \u09ad\u09b0\u09b8\u09be\u09b0 \u099c\u09be\u09df\u0997\u09be \u09a4\u09c8\u09b0\u09bf \u0995\u09b0\u09c7\u0964 \u09ac\u09cd\u09af\u0995\u09cd\u09a4\u09bf\u0997\u09a4 \u0986\u09ae\u09b2\u09c7 \u0986\u0996\u09bf\u09b0\u09be\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ab\u09b2\u09a4\u09be\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u0