anūn', 'इननल अल्लज़ीना आमनू वल्अल्लज़ीनाा हादू वन नसारा वस साबिईन मन आमन बिललाहि वल यवमिल आखिरि व अमिल सालिहन फ़लहुम अजरुहुम इनद रबबिहिम व ला खव फ़ुन अलैहिम व ला हुम यहज़नून', 'إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَٱلَّذِينَ هَادُوا۟ وَٱلنَّصَٰرَىٰ وَٱلصَّٰبِـِٔينَ مَنْ ءَامَنَ بِٱللَّهِ وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْءَاخِرِ وَعَمِلَ صَٰلِحًۭا فَلَهُمْ أَجْرُهُمْ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ وَلَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا هُمْ يَحْزَنُونَ', 'dua-for-faith-surah-al-baqara-2-62', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('edd826a4-b290-4fa1-b146-bd0304c5737c', 'dua', 'সাক্ষ্যদানকারীদের দলে লেখার দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة المائدة (5:83)', 'Dua of Those Moved to Tears — Record Us as Witnesses', 'ईमान की मजबूती की दुआ', 'ایمان کی مضبوطی کی دعا', 'হে আমাদের রব, আমরা ঈমান এনেছি; আমাদেরকে সাক্ষ্যদানকারীদের দলে লিখে দিন।', 'رَبَّنَآ ءَامَنَّا فَٱكْتُبْنَا مَعَ ٱلشَّٰهِدِينَ', 'Our Lord, we believe, so record us among the witnesses.', NULL, NULL, 'রাব্বানা আমান্না ফাকতুবনা মা''আশ শাহিদীন', 'Faith', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is faith, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, when heart feels weak and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for a steadfast heart upon faith | Surah Al-Maaidah 5:83", "search_intent": ["iman", "steadfast_heart", "truth"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-faith-surah-al-maaidah-5-83", "focus_keywords": ["dua for a steadfast heart upon faith", "quranic dua for faith", "surah al-maaidah 5:83"], "difficulty_level": "short", "meta_description": "Dua for a steadfast heart upon faith from Surah Al-Maaidah 5:83. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["faith", "iman", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u0988\u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a6\u09c3\u09a2\u09bc\u09a4\u09be\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be\u2014\u098f\u099f\u09be \u09b8\u09c7\u09ad \u0995\u09b0\u09c7 \u09b0\u09be\u0996\u09be\u09b0 \u09ae\u09a4\u09cb \u098f\u0995\u099f\u09bf \u09a6\u09cb\u09df\u09be\u0964 \u0986\u09aa\u09a8\u09bf \u0995\u09bf \u098f\u0987 \u0995\u09a5\u09be\u0997\u09c1\u09b2\u09cb \u0985\u09a8\u09c1\u09ad\u09ac \u0995\u09b0\u09c7\u09a8?", "social": {"short": "\u099a\u09be\u09aa\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ae\u09df\u09c7 \u09aa\u09dc\u09