 and steadiness.", "category_hierarchy": {"intent": "family_wellbeing", "primary": "Family", "secondary": "Household"}, "recommendation_tags": ["for_parents", "for_children", "home_dua", "after_salah"], "recommended_moments": ["after_salah", "family_gathering", "for_children"], "normalized_surah_names": ["Aal-i-Imraan"]}'::jsonb, 'published', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, TRUE, '56f216af-a404-48b5-a081-66a30de79989', '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', 'Falammā waqāthā qālat rabbī innī wadatuhā unsā wallāhu alamu bimā wadāt wa laisaz zakaru kalunsā wa innī sammantuhā maryama wa innī uīzuhā bika wa zurriyyatahā minash shaitānir rajīm', 'फ़लममा वक़ाथा क़ालत रबबि इननी वदतुहा उनसा वललाहु अलमु बिमा वदात व लैसज़ ज़करु कलुनसा व इननी सममैतुहा मरयम व इननी उईज़ुहा बिक व ज़ुररिययतहा मिनश शैतानिर रजीम', 'فَلَمَّا وَضَعَتْهَا قَالَتْ رَبِّ إِنِّى وَضَعْتُهَآ أُنثَىٰ وَٱللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا وَضَعَتْ وَلَيْسَ ٱلذَّكَرُ كَٱلْأُنثَىٰ ۖ وَإِنِّى سَمَّيْتُهَا مَرْيَمَ وَإِنِّىٓ أُعِيذُهَا بِكَ وَذُرِّيَّتَهَا مِنَ ٱلشَّيْطَٰنِ ٱلرَّجِيمِ', 'dua-for-family-surah-aal-i-imraan-3-36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
