 \u09b6\u09be\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09bf, \u09b8\u09ae\u09cd\u09aa\u09b0\u09cd\u0995\u09c7\u09b0 \u09ae\u09ae\u09a4\u09be, \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09bf\u09df\u099c\u09a8\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a8\u09bf\u09b0\u09be\u09aa\u09a4\u09cd\u09a4\u09be\u2014\u098f\u09b8\u09ac \u09a8\u09bf\u09df\u09a4 \u09a8\u09bf\u09df\u09c7 \u09aa\u09dc\u09c1\u09a8\u0964", "when_to_recite_en": "Recite consistently in times of pressure and prolonged waiting.", "category_hierarchy": {"intent": "reflection", "primary": "Repentance", "secondary": "Supplication"}, "recommendation_tags": ["after_salah", "daily_recitation", "night_dua", "reflection"], "recommended_moments": ["after_salah", "daily_reflection", "night"], "normalized_surah_names": ["Ad-Dukhan", "\u0627\u0644\u062f\u062e\u0627\u0646"]}'::jsonb, 'published', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, TRUE, '56f216af-a404-48b5-a081-66a30de79989', '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', 'Rabbanākshif ʿannal ʿadhāb', 'राबबानाकशिफ़ अाननाल अज़ाब', 'رَبَّنَا ٱكْشِفْ عَنَّا ٱلْعَذَابَ', 'dua-for-forgiveness-surah-ad-dukhaan-44-12', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ae1bd279-18d4-4ceb-bd48-1eec27903103', 'dua', 'ইবাদত কবুল হওয়ার দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ (2:127)', 'Dua for acceptance of worship', 'अमल की क़बूलियत की दुआ', 'قبولیتِ عبادت کی دعا', 'স্মরণ কর, যখন ইব্রাহীম ও ইসমাঈল কা’বাগৃহের ভিত্তি স্থাপন করছিল। তারা দোয়া করেছিলঃ পরওয়ারদেগার! আমাদের থেকে কবুল কর। নিশ্চয়ই তুমি শ্রবণকারী, সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'وَإِذْ يَرْفَعُ إِبْرَٰهِۦمُ ٱلْقَوَاعِدَ مِنَ ٱلْبَيْتِ وَإِسْمَٰعِيلُ رَبَّنَا تَقَبَّلْ مِنَّآ ۖ إِنَّكَ أَنتَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ', 'And when Abraham and Ishmael were raising the foundations of the Temple, [they prayed:] "O our Sustainer! Accept Thou this from us: for, verily, Thou alone art all-hearing, all-knowing!', NULL, NULL, 'ওয়া ইয ইয়ারফাউ ইবরাহীমুল কাওয়াইদা মিনাল বাইত ওয়া ইসমাঈল, রব্বানা তাকাব্বাল মিননা, ইন্নাকা আন্তাস সামীউল আলীম', 'Worship', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is worship, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, daily reflection and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for acceptance of worship | Surah Al-Baqara 2:127", "search_intent": ["reflection", "dua", "faith"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-forgiveness-surah-al-baqara-2-127", "focus_keywords": ["dua for acceptance of worship", "quranic dua for worship", "surah al-baqara 2:127"], "difficulty_level": "medium", "meta_description": "Dua for acceptance of worship from Surah Al-Baqara 2:127. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["worship", "reflection", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u0995\u0996\u09a8\u0993 \u09ae\u09a8\u09c7 \u09b9\u09af\u09bc, \u0986\u09b0\u09c7\u0995\u099f\u09c1 \u0986\u09b2\u09cb\u09b0 \u09a6\u09b0\u0995\u09be\u09b0\u0964 \u098f\u0987 \u09a6\u09cb\u09a