 trust in Allah\u2019s plan.", "category_hierarchy": {"intent": "reflection", "primary": "Worship", "secondary": "Supplication"}, "recommendation_tags": ["after_salah", "daily_recitation", "night_dua", "reflection"], "recommended_moments": ["after_salah", "daily_reflection", "night"], "normalized_surah_names": ["Al-Baqarah", "Al Baqara", "Baqarah", "\u0627\u0644\u0628\u0642\u0631\u0629"]}'::jsonb, 'published', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, TRUE, '56f216af-a404-48b5-a081-66a30de79989', '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', 'Wa idh yarfau ibrāhīm al-qawāida min al-bayt wa ismāʿīl al-rabbanā taqabbal minnā innaka anta samīʿu al-ʿalīm', 'व इध यरफ़ौ इबराहीम उ क़वाइद मिनल बैत व इसमाईलु रब्बना तक़बबल मिनना इननक अनतस समीउ अल अलीम', 'وَإِذْ يَرْفَعُ إِبْرَٰهِۦمُ ٱلْقَوَاعِدَ مِنَ ٱلْبَيْتِ وَإِسْمَٰعِيلُ رَبَّنَا تَقَبَّلْ مِنَّآ ۖ إِنَّكَ أَنتَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ', 'dua-for-forgiveness-surah-al-baqara-2-127', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://noorapp.in/assets/og-images/dua_acceptance_new.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('e2425a7b-a4e6-44f0-b589-be22f332333e', 'dua', 'আদম (আঃ)-এর তাওবার দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ (7:23)', 'Dua of Adam and Hawwa for Repentance', 'मग़फ़िरत और रहमत की दुआ', 'مغفرت اور رحمت کی دعا', 'তারা উভয়ে বললঃ হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা আমরা নিজেদের প্রতি জুলম করেছি। যদি আপনি আমাদেরকে ক্ষমা না করেন এবং আমাদের প্রতি অনুগ্রহ না করেন, তবে আমরা অবশ্যই অবশ্যই ধ্বংস হয়ে যাব।', 'قَالَا رَبَّنَا ظَلَمْنَآ أَنفُسَنَا وَإِن لَّمْ تَغْفِرْ لَنَا وَتَرْحَمْنَا لَنَكُونَنَّ مِنَ ٱلْخَٰسِرِينَ', 'The two replied: "O our Sustainer! We have sinned against ourselves -and unless Thou grant us forgiveness and bestow Thy mercy upon us, we shall most certainly be lost!"', NULL, NULL, 'কালা রাব্বানা যালামনা আনফুসানা ওয়াইল লাম তাগফির লানা ওয়াতারহামনা লানাকূনান্না মিনাল খাসিরীন', 'Forgiveness', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is forgiveness, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, after mistake and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for forgiveness and mercy | Surah Al-A''raaf 7:23", "search_intent": ["forgiveness", "mercy", "repentance"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-forgiveness-surah-al-araaf-7-23", "focus_keywords": ["dua for forgiveness and mercy", "quranic dua for forgiveness", "surah al-a''raaf 7:23"], "difficulty_level": "medium", "meta_description": "Dua for forgiveness and mercy from Surah Al-A''raaf 7:23. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["forgiveness", "forgiveness", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u09b0\u09be\u09a4 \u0997\u09ad\u09c0\u09b0 \u09b9\u09b2\u09c7 \u09b8\u09a4\u09cd\u09af\u09bf\u0995\u09be\u09b0\u09c7\u09b0 \u0995\u09a5\u09be\u0997\u09c1\u09b2\u09cb \u09b8\u09be\u09ae\u09a8\u09c7 \u0986