remain_firm", "primary": "Steadfastness", "secondary": "Perseverance"}, "recommendation_tags": ["during_hardship", "before_challenge", "after_salah", "night_dua"], "recommended_moments": ["during_hardship", "before_challenge", "after_salah"], "normalized_surah_names": ["Al-Baqarah", "Al Baqara", "Baqarah", "\u0627\u0644\u0628\u0642\u0631\u0629"]}'::jsonb, 'published', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, TRUE, '56f216af-a404-48b5-a081-66a30de79989', '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', 'Wa lammā barazū lijālūta wa junūdihī qālū rabbanā afrigh alainā sabranw wa sabbit aqdāmanā wansurnā ʿalā al-qawmil kāfirīn', 'व लममा बरज़ू लिजालूत व जुनूदिही क़ालू रब्बना अफ़रिघ अलैना सबरनव व सबबित अक़दामना वनसुरना अलल क़वमिल काफ़िरीन', 'وَلَمَّا بَرَزُوا۟ لِجَالُوتَ وَجُنُودِهِۦ قَالُوا۟ رَبَّنَآ أَفْرِغْ عَلَيْنَا صَبْرًۭا وَثَبِّتْ أَقْدَامَنَا وَٱنصُرْنَا عَلَى ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ', 'dua-for-patience-surah-al-baqara-2-250', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://noorapp.in/assets/og-images/dua_forgiveness_7_23.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('ff8705c3-8260-4a99-817a-c7c2cbaa519a', 'dua', 'রাত-দিন দানকারীর পুরস্কারের আয়াত', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ (2:274)', 'Verse on Those Who Give by Night and Day', 'हिदायत की दुआ', 'ہدایت کی دعا', 'যারা স্বীয় ধন-সম্পদ ব্যয় করে, রাত্রে ও দিনে, গোপনে ও প্রকাশ্যে। তাদের জন্যে তাদের সওয়াব রয়েছে তাদের পালনকর্তার কাছে। তাদের কোন আশংঙ্কা নেই এবং তারা চিন্তিত ও হবে না।', 'ٱلَّذِينَ يُنفِقُونَ أَمْوَٰلَهُم بِٱلَّيْلِ وَٱلنَّهَارِ سِرًّۭا وَعَلَانِيَةًۭ فَلَهُمْ أَجْرُهُمْ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ وَلَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا هُمْ يَحْزَنُونَ', 'Those who spend their possessions [for the sake of God] by night and by day, secretly and openly, shall have their reward with their Sustainer; and no fear need they have, and neither shall they grieve.', NULL, NULL, 'আল্লাযীনা ইয়ুনফিকূনা আমওয়ালাহুম বিললাইলি ওয়াননাহারি সিররাও ওয়া''আলানিয়াতান ফালাহুম আজরুহুম ইনদা রাব্বিহিম ওয়ালা খাওফুন আলাইহিম ওয়ালা হুম ইয়াহযানূন', 'Guidance', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is guidance, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, before decision and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for guidance and right direction | Surah Al-Baqara 2:274", "search_intent": ["guidance", "clarity", "right_decision"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-guidance-surah-al-baqara-2-274", "focus_keywords": ["dua for guidance and right direction", "quranic dua for guidance", "surah al-baqara 2:274"], "difficulty_level": "medium", "meta_description": "Dua for guidance and right direction from Surah Al-Baqara 2:274. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["guidance", "guidance", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u09aa\u09a5 \u09a8\u09bf\u09df\u09c7 \u09ad\u09c7\u09a