khawfun ʿalayhim wa lā hum yahzanūn', 'अल्अल्लज़ीनाा युनफ़िक़ून अमवालहुम बिललैलि वन नहारि सिररनव व अलानियतन फ़लहुम अजरुहुम इनद रबबिहिम व ला खव फ़ुन अलैहिम व ला हुम यहज़नून', 'ٱلَّذِينَ يُنفِقُونَ أَمْوَٰلَهُم بِٱلَّيْلِ وَٱلنَّهَارِ سِرًّۭا وَعَلَانِيَةًۭ فَلَهُمْ أَجْرُهُمْ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ وَلَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا هُمْ يَحْزَنُونَ', 'dua-for-guidance-surah-al-baqara-2-274', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('e57cb5f3-f5eb-4b1c-8afd-a4e3d1ecccc5', 'dua', 'গুনাহ মাফ ও জাহান্নাম থেকে রক্ষার দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ آلِ عِمۡرَانَ (3:16)', 'Dua of Believers for Forgiveness and Safety from the Fire', 'मग़फ़िरत और रहमत की दुआ', 'مغفرت اور رحمت کی دعا', 'যারা বলে, হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা, আমরা ঈমান এনেছি, কাজেই আমাদের গোনাহ ক্ষমা করে দাও আর আমাদেরকে দোযখের আযাব থেকে রক্ষা কর।', 'ٱلَّذِينَ يَقُولُونَ رَبَّنَآ إِنَّنَآ ءَامَنَّا فَٱغْفِرْ لَنَا ذُنُوبَنَا وَقِنَا عَذَابَ ٱلنَّارِ', 'those who say, "O our Sustainer! Behold, we believe [in Thee]; forgive us, then, our sins, and keep us safe from suffering through the fire" -:', NULL, NULL, 'আল্লাযীনা ইয়াকূলূনা রাব্বানা ইন্নানা আমান্না ফাগফির লানা যুনূবানা ওয়াকিনা আযাবান নার', 'Forgiveness', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is forgiveness, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, after mistake and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for forgiveness and mercy | Surah Aal-i-Imraan 3:16", "search_intent": ["forgiveness", "mercy", "repentance"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-protection-surah-aal-i-imraan-3-16", "focus_keywords": ["dua for forgiveness and mercy", "quranic dua for forgiveness", "surah aal-i-imraan 3:16"], "difficulty_level": "medium", "meta_description": "Dua for forgiveness and mercy from Surah Aal-i-Imraan 3:16. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["forgiveness", "forgiveness", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u09ae\u09be\u0997\u09ab\u09bf\u09b0\u09be\u09a4 \u0993 \u09b0\u09b9\u09ae\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be\u2014\u098f\u0987 \u09a6\u09cb\u09df\u09be \u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09c1\u09b7\u0995\u09c7 \u09a7\u09c0\u09b0\u09c7 \u09a7\u09