rah aal-i-imraan 3:35"], "ur": ["\u06c1\u062f\u0627\u06cc\u062a \u06a9\u06cc \u062f\u0639\u0627", "guidance \u0633\u06d2 \u0645\u062a\u0639\u0644\u0642 \u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646\u06cc \u062f\u0639\u0627", "Surah Aal-i-Imraan 3:35"], "romanized": ["dua for family surah aal i imraan 3 35", "dua for guidance"]}, "virtue_reference": "Quran 40:60", "semantic_entities": ["Allah", "Guidance", "Clarity", "Acceptance"], "when_to_recite_bn": "\u09b8\u09be\u09b2\u09be\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u09aa\u09b0 \u0995\u09df\u09c7\u0995\u09ac\u09be\u09b0 \u09aa\u09dc\u09b2\u09c7 \u09ae\u09a8\u09cb\u09af\u09cb\u0997 \u09ac\u09be\u09dc\u09c7\u0964", "when_to_recite_en": "Recite after salah when you want sincerity and steadiness.", "category_hierarchy": {"intent": "seeking_clarity", "primary": "Guidance", "secondary": "Direction"}, "recommendation_tags": ["after_salah", "before_decision", "daily_recitation", "seeking_clarity"], "recommended_moments": ["after_salah", "before_decision", "during_confusion"], "normalized_surah_names": ["Aal-i-Imraan"]}'::jsonb, 'published', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, TRUE, '56f216af-a404-48b5-a081-66a30de79989', '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', 'Idh qālatim ra atu imrāna rabbī innī nazartu laka mā fī batnī muharraran fataqabbal minnī innaka anta samīʿu al-ʿalīm', 'इध क़ालतिम र अतु इमरान रबबि इननी नज़रतु लक मा फ़ी बतनी मुहरररन फ़तक़बबल मिननी इननक अनतस समीउ अल अलीम', 'إِذْ قَالَتِ ٱمْرَأَتُ عِمْرَٰنَ رَبِّ إِنِّى نَذَرْتُ لَكَ مَا فِى بَطْنِى مُحَرَّرًۭا فَتَقَبَّلْ مِنِّىٓ ۖ إِنَّكَ أَنتَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ', 'dua-for-family-surah-aal-i-imraan-3-35', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('e67236bc-c02b-4fdc-9a7a-c3277dcf03ef', 'dua', 'যাকারিয়া (আ.)-এর দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ (21:89)', 'Dua of Zakariya — Leave Me Not Alone', 'परिवार और नेक औलाद की भलाई की दुआ', 'اہلِ خانہ اور اولاد کی بھلائی کی دعا', 'এবং যাকারিয়ার কথা স্মরণ করুন, যখন সে তার পালনকর্তাকে আহবান করেছিল; হে আমার পালনকর্তা আমাকে একা রেখো না। তুমি তো উত্তম ওয়ারিস।', 'وَزَكَرِيَّآ إِذْ نَادَىٰ رَبَّهُۥ رَبِّ لَا تَذَرْنِى فَرْدًۭا وَأَنتَ خَيْرُ ٱلْوَٰرِثِينَ', 'AND [thus did We deliver] Zachariah when he cried out unto his Sustainer: “O my Sustainer! Leave me not childless! But [even if Thou grant me no bodily heir, I know that] Thou wilt remain when all else has ceased to be!”', NULL, NULL, 'ওয়াযাকারিয়্যা ইয নাদা রাব্বাহূ রাব্বি লা তাযারনী ফারদাও ওয়াআন্তা খাইরুল ওয়ারিসীন', 'Family', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is family, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, family gathering and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for righteous family and offspring | Surah Al-Anbiyaa 21:89", "search_intent": ["family", "offspring", "righteous_home"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-family-surah-al-anbiyaa-21-89", "focus_keywords": ["dua for righteous family and offspring", "quranic dua for family", "surah al-anbiyaa 21:89"], "difficulty_level": "medium", "meta_description": "Dua for righteous family and offspring from Surah Al-Anbiyaa 21:89. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["family", "family", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u09aa\u09b0\u09bf\u09ac\u09be\u09b0 \u0993 \u09b8\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09be\u09a8\u09c7\u09b0 \u0995\u09b2\u09cd\u09af\u09be\u09a3\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be\u2014\u09ac\u