9+00:00', 'Wa zakariyyā idh nādā rabbahū rabbī lā tazarnī fardanw wa anta khairul wārisīn', 'व ज़करियया इध नादा रबबहू रबबि ला तज़रनी फ़रदनव व अनत खैरुल वारिसीन', 'وَزَكَرِيَّآ إِذْ نَادَىٰ رَبَّهُۥ رَبِّ لَا تَذَرْنِى فَرْدًۭا وَأَنتَ خَيْرُ ٱلْوَٰرِثِينَ', 'dua-for-family-surah-al-anbiyaa-21-89', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('c979768b-b304-4a92-89c7-a77b97cd0647', 'dua', 'আল্লাহকে গভীরভাবে স্মরণের নির্দেশ — আয়াত', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ (2:200)', 'Call to remember Allah with sincere remembrance', 'माँ-बाप पर रहमत की दुआ', 'اللہ کے ذکر اور یاد کی دعا', 'আর অতঃপর যখন হজ্জ্বের যাবতীয় অনুষ্ঠানক্রিয়াদি সমাপ্ত করে সারবে, তখন স্মরণ করবে আল্লাহকে, যেমন করে তোমরা স্মরণ করতে নিজেদের বাপ-দাদাদেরকে; বরং তার চেয়েও বেশী স্মরণ করবে। তারপর অনেকে তো বলে যে পরওয়াদেগার! আমাদিগকে দুনিয়াতে দান কর। অথচ তার জন্যে পরকালে কোন অংশ নেই।', 'فَإِذَا قَضَيْتُم مَّنَٰسِكَكُمْ فَٱذْكُرُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ كَذِكْرِكُمْ ءَابَآءَكُمْ أَوْ أَشَدَّ ذِكْرًۭا ۗ فَمِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ مَن يَقُولُ رَبَّنَآ ءَاتِنَا فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا وَمَا لَهُۥ فِى ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ مِنْ خَلَٰقٍۢ', 'And when you have performed your acts of worship, [continue to] bear God in mind as you would bear your own fathers in mind-nay, with a yet keener remembrance! For there are people who [merely] pray, "O our Sustainer! Give us in this world" -and such shall not partake in the blessings of the life to come.', NULL, NULL, 'ফাইযা কাদাইতুম মানাসিকাকুম ফাযকুরুল্লাহা কাযিকরিকুম আবাআকুম আও আশাদ্দা যিকরান ফামিনান নাসি মাই ইয়াকূলু রাব্বানা আতিনা ফিদ দুনইয়া ওয়ামা লাহূ ফিল আখিরাতি মিন খালাক', 'Remembrance', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is remembrance, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, daily reflection and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Remember Allah with Sincere Remembrance | Al-Baqara 2:200", "search_intent": ["reflection", "dua", "faith"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-family-surah-al-baqara-2-200", "focus_keywords": ["call to remember allah with sincere remembrance", "quranic dua for remembrance", "surah al-baqara 2:200"], "difficulty_level": "long", "meta_description": "Call to remember Allah with sincere remembrance from Surah Al-Baqara 2:200. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["remembrance", "reflection", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u0986\u09b2\u09cd\u09b2\u09be\u09b9\u09b0 \u099c\u09bf\u0995\u09bf\u09b0 \u0993 \u09b8\u09cd\u09ae\u09b0\u09a3\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be\u2014\u09ac\u09be\u09b0\u09ac\u09be\u09b0 \u09aa\u09dc\u09b2\u09c7 \u0995\u09a5\u09be\u0997\u09c1\u09b2\u09cb \u0985\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09b0\u09c7 \u09a8\u09c7\u09ae\u09c7 \u09af\u09be\u09df\u0964 \u098f\u099f\u09be \u0995\u09bf \u0986\u09aa\u09a8\u09be\u09b0\u0993 \u09a6\u09b0\u0995\u09be\u09b0?", "social": {"short": "\u09ad\u09bf\u09a4\u09b0\u099f\u09be \u0997\u09c1\u099b\u09bf\u09df\u09c7 \u09a8\u09c7\u0993\u09df\u09be\u09b0 \u0986\u09df\u09be\u09a4 \u2022 2:200", "facebook": "\u0986\u09b2\u09cd\u09b2\u09be\u09b9\u09b0 \u099c\u09bf\u0995\u09bf\u09b0 \u0993 \u09b8\u09cd\u09ae\u09b0\u09a3\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be (Surah Al-Baqara 2:200) \u2014 \u0995\u09be\u0989\u0995\u09c7 \u099f\u09cd\u09af\u09be\u0997 \u09a8\u09be \u0995\u09b0\u09c7\u0993 \u09aa\u09be\u09a0\u09bf\u09df\u09c7 \u09a6\u09bf\u09a4\u09c7 \u09aa\u09be\u09b0\u09c7\u09a8\u2014\u09b9\u09df\u09a4\u09cb \u0995\u09be\u09b0\u0993 \u0996\u09c1\u09ac \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09df\u09cb\u099c\u09a8\u0964", "whatsapp": "\u0986\u09b2\u09cd\u09b2\u09be\u09b9\u09b0 \u099c\u09bf\u0995\u09bf\u09b0 \u0993 \u09b8\u09cd\u09ae\u09b0\u09a3\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be (Surah Al-Baqara 2:200). \u098f\u099f\u09be \u09aa\u09dc\u09c7 \u09a6\u09cb\u09df\u09be \u0995\u09b0\u09ac\u09c7\u09a8 \u0986\u09ae\u09be\u09b0 \u099c\u09a8\u09cd\u09af\u0993\u0964"}, "source": "Quran", "virtue": "Dua relieves burden by turning the heart fully to Allah.", "emotion": ["peace", "hope", "resilience"], "benefits": ["\u099a\u09be\u09aa\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ae\u09df \u09b9\u09a0\u09be\u09ce \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09