mbrance", "secondary": "Supplication"}, "recommendation_tags": ["after_salah", "daily_recitation", "night_dua", "reflection"], "recommended_moments": ["after_salah", "daily_reflection", "night"], "normalized_surah_names": ["Al-Baqarah", "Al Baqara", "Baqarah", "\u0627\u0644\u0628\u0642\u0631\u0629"]}'::jsonb, 'published', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, TRUE, '56f216af-a404-48b5-a081-66a30de79989', '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', 'Fa izan qadaitum manā sikakum fazkurul lāha kazikrikum ābākum aw ashadda zikrā faminannāsi man yaqūlu rabbanā ātinā fiddunyā wa mā lahū fī al-ākhirati min khalāq', 'फ़ इधन क़दैतुम मना सिककुम फ़ज़कुरुल लाह कज़िकरिकुम आबाकुम अव अशदद ज़िकरा फ़मिनननासि मै यक़ूलु रब्बना आतिना फ़िददुन्या व मा लहू फ़ी अल आखिरति मिन खलाक़', 'فَإِذَا قَضَيْتُم مَّنَٰسِكَكُمْ فَٱذْكُرُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ كَذِكْرِكُمْ ءَابَآءَكُمْ أَوْ أَشَدَّ ذِكْرًۭا ۗ فَمِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ مَن يَقُولُ رَبَّنَآ ءَاتِنَا فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا وَمَا لَهُۥ فِى ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ مِنْ خَلَٰقٍۢ', 'dua-for-family-surah-al-baqara-2-200', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('85d74335-d8d6-44bb-8627-d64f0d1e2768', 'dua', 'চোখ জুড়ানো পরিবারের দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ (25:74)', 'Dua for Spouses and Children Who Comfort the Eyes', 'परिवार और नेक औलाद की भलाई की दुआ', 'اہلِ خانہ اور اولاد کی بھلائی کی دعا', 'এবং যারা বলে, হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা, আমাদের স্ত্রীদের পক্ষ থেকে এবং আমাদের সন্তানের পক্ষ থেকে আমাদের জন্যে চোখের শীতলতা দান কর এবং আমাদেরকে মুত্তাকীদের জন্যে আদর্শস্বরূপ কর।', 'وَٱلَّذِينَ يَقُولُونَ رَبَّنَا هَبْ لَنَا مِنْ أَزْوَٰجِنَا وَذُرِّيَّٰتِنَا قُرَّةَ أَعْيُنٍۢ وَٱجْعَلْنَا لِلْمُتَّقِينَ إِمَامًا', 'and who pray “O our Sustainer! Grant that our spouses and our offspring be a joy to our eyes, and cause us to be foremost among those who are conscious of Thee!”', NULL, NULL, 'ওয়াললাযীনা ইয়াকূলূনা রাব্বানা হাব লানা মিন আযওয়াজিনা ওয়াযুররিয়্যাতিনা কুররাতা আ''ইয়ুনিও ওয়াজ''আলনা লিলমুত্তাকীনা ইমামা', 'Family', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is family, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, family gathering and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for righteous family and offspring | Surah Al-Furqaan 25:74", "search_intent": ["family", "offspring", "righteous_home"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-family-surah-al-furqaan-25-74", "focus_keywords": ["dua for righteous family and offspring", "quranic dua for family", "surah al-furqaan 25:74"], "difficulty_level": "medium", "meta_description": "Dua for righteous family and offspring from Surah Al-Furqaan 25:74. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["family", "family", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u098f\u099f\u09be \u0995\u09bf \u0986\u09aa\u09a8\u09be\u09b0\u0993 \u09a6\u09b0\u0995\u09be\u09b0? \u09