ames": ["Ghafir"]}'::jsonb, 'published', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, TRUE, '56f216af-a404-48b5-a081-66a30de79989', '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', 'Rabbanā wa adkhilhum jannāti adninil latī wāttahum wa man sallāha min ābāihim wa azwājihim wa zurriyyātihim innaka anta al-azīzul ḥakīm', 'रबबनना व अदखिलहुम जननाति अदनिनिल लती वाततहुम व मन सलह मिन आबाइहिम व अज़वाजिहिम व ज़ुररिययातिहिम इननक अनतल अज़ीज़ुल हकीम', 'رَبَّنَا وَأَدْخِلْهُمْ جَنَّٰتِ عَدْنٍ ٱلَّتِى وَعَدتَّهُمْ وَمَن صَلَحَ مِنْ ءَابَآئِهِمْ وَأَزْوَٰجِهِمْ وَذُرِّيَّٰتِهِمْ ۚ إِنَّكَ أَنتَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلْحَكِيمُ', 'dua-for-family-surah-ghafir-40-8', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('45ec4693-9985-4669-8e1e-627bfe2a9fb0', 'dua', 'সন্তানসহ নামাজি হওয়ার দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ إِبۡرَاهِيمَ (14:40)', 'Dua of Ibrahim to Remain Steadfast in Prayer', 'परिवार और नेक औलाद की भलाई की दुआ', 'اہلِ خانہ اور اولاد کی بھلائی کی دعا', 'হে আমার পালনকর্তা, আমাকে নামায কায়েমকারী করুন এবং আমার সন্তানদের মধ্যে থেকেও। হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা, এবং কবুল করুন আমাদের দোয়া।', 'رَبِّ ٱجْعَلْنِى مُقِيمَ ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ وَمِن ذُرِّيَّتِى ۚ رَبَّنَا وَتَقَبَّلْ دُعَآءِ', '[hence,] O my Sustainer, cause me and [some] of my offspring to remain constant in prayer! "And, O our Sustainer, accept this my prayer:', NULL, NULL, 'রাব্বিজ''আলনী মুকীমাস সালাওয়াতি ওয়ামিন যুররিয়্যাতী রাব্বানা ওয়াতাকাব্বাল দু''আ', 'Family', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is family, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, family gathering and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for righteous family and offspring | Surah Ibrahim 14:40", "search_intent": ["family", "offspring", "righteous_home"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-family-surah-ibrahim-14-40", "focus_keywords": ["dua for righteous family and offspring", "quranic dua for family", "surah ibrahim 14:40"], "difficulty_level": "medium", "meta_description": "Dua for righteous family and offspring from Surah Ibrahim 14:40. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["family", "family", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u098f\u0987 \u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09b6\u09cd\u09a8\u099f\u09be \u0985\u09a8\u09c7\u0995\u09c7\u0987 \u0995\u09b0\u09c7\u09a8: \u098f\u0996\u09a8 \u0995\u09c0 \u0995\u09b0\u09ac? \u09aa\u09b0\u09bf\u09ac\u09be\u09b0 \u0993 \u09b8\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09be\u09a8\u09c7\u09b0 \u0995\u0