िनू बि रबबिकुम फ़ आमनना रब्बना फ़घफ़िर लना ज़ुनूबना व कफ़फ़िर अनना सैयि आतिन व तवफ़फ़ना माल अबरार', 'رَّبَّنَآ إِنَّنَا سَمِعْنَا مُنَادِيًۭا يُنَادِى لِلْإِيمَٰنِ أَنْ ءَامِنُوا۟ بِرَبِّكُمْ فَـَٔامَنَّا ۚ رَبَّنَا فَٱغْفِرْ لَنَا ذُنُوبَنَا وَكَفِّرْ عَنَّا سَيِّـَٔاتِنَا وَتَوَفَّنَا مَعَ ٱلْأَبْرَارِ', 'dua-for-forgiveness-surah-aal-i-imraan-3-193', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('efa53e9b-8d4e-4357-b320-86442b198590', 'dua', 'ইউনুস (আ.)-এর দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ (21:87)', 'Dua of Yunus in the Belly of the Fish', 'हिदायत की दुआ', 'ہدایت کی دعا', 'এবং মাছওয়ালার কথা স্মরণ করুন তিনি ক্রুদ্ধ হয়ে চলে গিয়েছিলেন, অতঃপর মনে করেছিলেন যে, আমি তাঁকে ধৃত করতে পারব না। অতঃপর তিনি অন্ধকারের মধ্যে আহবান করলেনঃ তুমি ব্যতীত কোন উপাস্য নেই; তুমি নির্দোষ আমি গুনাহগার।', 'وَذَا ٱلنُّونِ إِذ ذَّهَبَ مُغَٰضِبًۭا فَظَنَّ أَن لَّن نَّقْدِرَ عَلَيْهِ فَنَادَىٰ فِى ٱلظُّلُمَٰتِ أَن لَّآ إِلَٰهَ إِلَّآ أَنتَ سُبْحَٰنَكَ إِنِّى كُنتُ مِنَ ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ', 'AND [remember] him of the great fish when he went off in wrath, thinking that We had no power over him! But then heeded out in the deep darkness [of his distress]: “There is no deity save Thee! Limit­less art Thou in Thy glory! Verily, I have done wrong!”', NULL, NULL, 'ওয়াযান নূনি ইয যাহাবা মুগাদিবান ফাযান্না আল লান নাকদিরা আলাইহি ফানাদা ফিয যুলুমাতি আল লা ইলাহা ইল্লা আন্তা সুবহানাকা ইন্নী কুন্তু মিনায যালিমীন', 'Guidance', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is guidance, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, before decision and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for guidance and right direction | Surah Al-Anbiyaa 21:87", "search_intent": ["guidance", "clarity", "right_decision"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-forgiveness-surah-al-anbiyaa-21-87", "focus_keywords": ["dua for guidance and right direction", "quranic dua for guidance", "surah al-anbiyaa 21:87"], "difficulty_level": "long", "meta_description": "Dua for guidance and right direction from Surah Al-Anbiyaa 21:87. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["guidance", "guidance", "quranic supplica