tajʿal fī qulūbinā ghillalil alladhīna āmanū rabbanā innaka raūfur raḥīm', 'वल्अल्लज़ीनाा जाऊ मिन बदिहिम यक़ूलून रब्बना ग़फ़िर फ़िर लना व लि इखवानि नल अल्लज़ीना सबक़ूना बि अल ईमानि व ला तजअल फ़ी कुलूबिना घिलललि अल अल्लज़ीना आमनू रबबनना इननक रऊफ़ुर रहीम', 'وَٱلَّذِينَ جَآءُو مِنۢ بَعْدِهِمْ يَقُولُونَ رَبَّنَا ٱغْفِرْ لَنَا وَلِإِخْوَٰنِنَا ٱلَّذِينَ سَبَقُونَا بِٱلْإِيمَٰنِ وَلَا تَجْعَلْ فِى قُلُوبِنَا غِلًّۭا لِّلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ رَبَّنَآ إِنَّكَ رَءُوفٌۭ رَّحِيمٌ', 'dua-for-forgiveness-surah-al-hashr-59-10', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('2aad3ccf-11e5-44b8-961e-14bd30dd0c18', 'dua', 'মুমিনদের ক্ষমা ও রহমতের দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ (23:109)', 'Dua of Believing Servants for Forgiveness and Mercy', 'मग़फ़िरत और रहमत की दुआ', 'مغفرت اور رحمت کی دعا', 'আমার বান্দাদের একদলে বলতঃ হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা! আমরা বিশ্বাস স্থাপন করেছি। অতএব তুমি আমাদেরকে ক্ষমা কর ও আমাদের প্রতি রহম কর। তুমি তো দয়ালুদের মধ্যে শ্রেষ্ঠ দয়ালু।', 'إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ فَرِيقٌۭ مِّنْ عِبَادِى يَقُولُونَ رَبَّنَآ ءَامَنَّا فَٱغْفِرْ لَنَا وَٱرْحَمْنَا وَأَنتَ خَيْرُ ٱلرَّٰحِمِينَ', '“Behold, there were among My servants such as would pray, ‘O our Sustainer! We have come to believe [in Thee]; forgive, then, our sins and bestow Thy mercy on us: for Thou art the truest bestower of mercy!’', NULL, NULL, 'ইন্নাহূ কানা ফারীকুম মিন ইবাদী ইয়াকূলূনা রাব্বানা আমান্না ফাগফির লানা ওয়ারহামনা ওয়াআন্তা খাইরুর রাহিমীন', 'Forgiveness', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is forgiveness, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, after mistake and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for forgiveness and mercy | Surah Al-Muminoon 23:109", "search_intent": ["forgiveness", "mercy", "repentance"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-forgiveness-surah-al-muminoon-23-109", "focus_keywords": ["dua for forgiveness and mercy", "quranic dua for forgiveness", "surah al-muminoon 23:109"], "difficulty_level": "medium", "meta_description": "Dua for forgiveness and mercy from Surah Al-Muminoon 23:109. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["forgiveness", "forgiveness", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u09aa\u09cd\u09b0\u09bf\u09df\u099c\u09a8\u09c7\u09b0 \u099c\u09a8\u09cd\u09af \u09a6\u09cb\u09df\u09be 