-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, TRUE, '56f216af-a404-48b5-a081-66a30de79989', '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', 'Innahū kāna farīqum min ibādī yaqūlūna rabbanā āmannā faghfir lanā warhamnā wa anta khairur rāhimīn', 'इननहू कान फ़रीकुम मिन इबादी यक़ूलून रब्बना आमनना फ़घफ़िर लना वरहमना व अनत खैरुर राहिमीन', 'إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ فَرِيقٌۭ مِّنْ عِبَادِى يَقُولُونَ رَبَّنَآ ءَامَنَّا فَٱغْفِرْ لَنَا وَٱرْحَمْنَا وَأَنتَ خَيْرُ ٱلرَّٰحِمِينَ', 'dua-for-forgiveness-surah-al-muminoon-23-109', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('44ea062e-effd-46bd-af38-28bf29a7c8df', 'dua', 'নিজের ভুল স্বীকার করে ক্ষমার দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ القَصَصِ (28:16)', 'Dua of Musa Confessing His Fault', 'मग़फ़िरत और रहमत की दुआ', 'مغفرت اور رحمت کی دعا', 'তিনি বললেন, হে আমার পালনকর্তা, আমি তো নিজের উপর জুলুম করে ফেলেছি। অতএব, আমাকে ক্ষমা করুন। আল্লাহ তাকে ক্ষমা করলেন। নিশ্চয় তিনি ক্ষমাশীল, দয়ালু।', 'قَالَ رَبِّ إِنِّى ظَلَمْتُ نَفْسِى فَٱغْفِرْ لِى فَغَفَرَ لَهُۥٓ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ ٱلْغَفُورُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ', '[And] he prayed: O my Sustainer! Verily, I have sinned against myself! Grant me, then, Thy forgiveness!” And He forgave him - for, verily, He alone is truly forgiving, a dispenser of grace.', NULL, NULL, 'কালা রাব্বি ইন্নী যালামতু নাফসী ফাগফির লী ফাগাফারা লাহূ ইন্নাহূ হুওয়াল গাফূরুর রাহীম', 'Forgiveness', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is forgiveness, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, after mistake and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for forgiveness and mercy | Surah Al-Qasas 28:16", "search_intent": ["forgiveness", "mercy", "repentance"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-forgiveness-surah-al-qasas-28-16", "focus_keywords": ["dua for forgiveness and mercy", "quranic dua for forgiveness", "surah al-qasas 28:16"], "difficulty_level": "medium", "meta_description": "Dua for forgiveness and mercy from Surah Al-Qasas 28:16. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["forgiveness", "forgiveness", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u09ae\u09be\u0997\u09ab\u09bf\u09b0\u09be\u09a4 \u0993 \u09b0\u09b9\u09ae\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be\u2014\u098f\u0987 \u09a6\u09cb\u09df\u09be \u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09c1\u09b7\u0995\u09c7 \u09a7\u09c0