\u099c\u09a8\u09cd\u09af \u09a8\u09c0\u09b0\u09ac \u09b8\u0999\u09cd\u0997\u09c0\u0964"], "og_image_data": {"title": {"bn": "\u09b9\u09df\u09a4\u09cb \u0986\u09b2\u09cd\u09b2\u09be\u09b9\u09b0 \u09a6\u09bf\u0995\u09c7 \u09a4\u09be\u0995\u09be\u09a8\u09cb\u09b0 \u098f\u099f\u09be\u0987 \u09b8\u09ae\u09df\u0964 \u09b9\u09c7\u09a6\u09be\u09af\u09bc\u09be\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be \u09a4\u0996\u09a8 \u09ac\u09bf\u09b6\u09c7\u09b7\u09ad\u09be\u09ac\u09c7 \u09ae\u09a8\u09c7 \u09a7\u09b0\u09be \u09a6\u09c7\u09df\u0964 \u09a8\u09bf\u09df\u09a4 \u09a0\u09bf\u0995 \u09b0\u09be\u0996\u09c1\u09a8\u0964", "en": "For days that feel heavy, this verse brings direction and softness. Dua for guidance and right direction", "ur": "\u06cc\u06c1 \u062f\u0639\u0627 \u062e\u0627\u0645\u0648\u0634\u06cc \u0645\u06cc\u06ba \u0628\u06be\u06cc \u0631\u0628 \u0633\u06d2 \u062c\u0648\u0691 \u062f\u06cc\u062a\u06cc \u06c1\u06d2\u06d4 \u06c1\u062f\u0627\u06cc\u062a \u06a9\u06cc \u062f\u0639\u0627"}, "bg_theme": "islamic gradient", "subtitle": "Surah Aal-i-Imraan 3:51 \u2022 \u09ad\u09c7\u09a4\u09b0\u09c7\u09b0 \u099a\u09be\u09aa \u0995\u09ae\u09bf\u09df\u09c7 \u0986\u09b2\u09cd\u09b2\u09be\u09b9\u09b0 \u09a6\u09bf\u0995\u09c7 \u09ab\u09c7\u09b0\u09be\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09df\u09be"}, "time_required": "35 sec", "search_aliases": {"bn": ["\u09b9\u09c7\u09a6\u09be\u09af\u09bc\u09be\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be", "guidance \u098f\u09b0 \u0995\u09c1\u09b0\u0986\u09a8\u09bf\u0995 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be", "Surah Aal-i-Imraan 3:51"], "en": ["dua for guidance and right direction", "guidance dua", "surah aal-i-imraan 3:51"], "ur": ["\u06c1\u062f\u0627\u06cc\u062a \u06a9\u06cc \u062f\u0639\u0627", "guidance \u0633\u06d2 \u0645\u062a\u0639\u0644\u0642 \u0642\u0631\u0622\u0646\u06cc \u062f\u0639\u0627", "Surah Aal-i-Imraan 3:51"], "romanized": ["dua for guidance surah aal i imraan 3 51", "dua for guidance"]}, "virtue_reference": "Quran 40:60", "semantic_entities": ["Allah", "Guidance", "Clarity", "Worship"], "when_to_recite_bn": "\u09ad\u09df \u09ac\u09be \u0985\u09aa\u09b0\u09be\u09a7\u09ac\u09cb\u09a7\u09c7 \u09a8\u09bf\u099c\u09c7\u0995\u09c7 \u0997\u09c1\u099f\u09bf\u09df\u09c7 \u09a8\u09bf\u09b2\u09c7 \u098f\u099f\u09bf \u09aa\u09dc\u09c1\u09a8\u0964", "when_to_recite_en": "Recite during fear, guilt, or uncertainty, asking Allah for ease.", "category_hierarchy": {"intent": "seeking_clarity", "primary": "Guidance", "secondary": "Direction"}, "recommendation_tags": ["after_salah", "before_decision", "daily_recitation", "seeking_clarity"], "recommended_moments": ["after_salah", "before_decision", "during_confusion"], "normalized_surah_names": ["Aal-i-Imraan"]}'::jsonb, 'published', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, TRUE, '56f216af-a404-48b5-a081-66a30de79989', '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', 'Innal lāha rabbī wa rabbukum fabudūh hāzā sirātum mustaqīm', 'इननल लाह रबबी व रबबुकुम फ़बुदूह हाज़ा सिरातुम मुसतक़ीम', 'إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ رَبِّى وَرَبُّكُمْ فَٱعْبُدُوهُ ۗ هَٰذَا صِرَٰطٌۭ مُّسْتَقِيمٌۭ', 'dua-for-guidance-surah-aal-i-imraan-3-51', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('d3838d51-82e8-4e2c-bb27-a5a62cda9909', 'dua', 'হেদায়াত একমাত্র আল্লাহর — আয়াত', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ آلِ عِمۡرَانَ (3:73)', 'Verse — All Bounty Is in Allah''s Hand', 'ईमान की मजबूती की दुआ', 'ایمان کی مضبوطی کی دعا', 'যারা তোমাদের ধর্মমতে চলবে, তাদের ছাড়া আর কাউকে বিশ্বাস করবে না। বলে দিন নিঃসন্দেহে হেদায়েত সেটাই, যে হেদায়েত আল্লাহ করেন। আর এসব কিছু এ জন্যে যে, তোমরা যা লাভ করেছিলে তা অন্য কেউ কেন প্রাপ্ত হবে, কিংবা তোমাদের পালনকর্তার সামনে তোমাদের উপর তারা কেন প্রবল হয়ে যাবে! বলে দিন, মর্যাদা আল্লাহরই হাতে; তিনি যাকে ইচ্ছা দান করেন এবং আল্লাহ প্রাচুর্যময় ও সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'وَلَا تُؤْمِنُوٓا۟ إِلَّا لِمَن تَبِعَ دِينَكُمْ قُلْ إِنَّ ٱلْهُدَىٰ هُدَى ٱللَّهِ أَن يُؤْتَىٰٓ أَحَدٌۭ مِّثْلَ مَآ أُوتِيتُمْ أَوْ يُحَآجُّوكُمْ عِندَ رَبِّكُمْ ۗ قُلْ إِنَّ ٱلْفَضْلَ بِيَدِ ٱللَّهِ يُؤْتِيهِ مَن يَشَآءُ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ وَٰسِعٌ عَلِيمٌۭ', 'but do not [really] believe anyone who does not follow your own faith." Say: "Behold, all [true] guidance is God''s guidance, consisting in one''s being granted [revelation] such as you have been granted." Or would they contend against you before your Sustainer? Say: "Behold, all bounty is in the hand of God; He grants it unto whom He wills: for God is infinite, all-knowing,', NULL, NULL, 'ওয়ালা তু''মিনূ ইল্লা লিমান তাবি''আ দীনাকুম কুল ইন্নাল হুদা হুদাল্লাহি আই ইয়ু''তা আহাদুম মিসলা মা ঊতীতুম আও ইয়ুহাজ্জূকুম ইনদা রাব্বিকুম কুল ইন্নাল ফাদলা বিয়াদিল্লাহি ইয়ু''তীহি মাই ইয়াশাউ ওয়াল্লাহু ওয়াসি''উন আলীম', 'Faith', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is faith, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, when heart feels weak and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for a steadfast heart upon faith | Surah Aal-i-Imraan 3:73", "search_in