bikum qul innal fadla biyadil lāh yutīhi man yashā wallāhu wāsiun ʿalīm', 'व ला तुमिनू इलला लिमन तबिअ दीनकुम कुल इननल हुदा हुदल लाहि ऐ युता अहदुम मिसल मा ऊतीतुम अव युहाजजूकुम इनद रबबिकुम कुल इननल फ़दल बियदिल लाह युतीहि मै यशा वललाहु वासिउन अलीम', 'وَلَا تُؤْمِنُوٓا۟ إِلَّا لِمَن تَبِعَ دِينَكُمْ قُلْ إِنَّ ٱلْهُدَىٰ هُدَى ٱللَّهِ أَن يُؤْتَىٰٓ أَحَدٌۭ مِّثْلَ مَآ أُوتِيتُمْ أَوْ يُحَآجُّوكُمْ عِندَ رَبِّكُمْ ۗ قُلْ إِنَّ ٱلْفَضْلَ بِيَدِ ٱللَّهِ يُؤْتِيهِ مَن يَشَآءُ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ وَٰسِعٌ عَلِيمٌۭ', 'dua-for-guidance-surah-aal-i-imraan-3-73', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('8ce93ff3-d9e6-4834-8310-c5d5b7911885', 'dua', 'কিয়ামতে সমবেত হওয়ার বিশ্বাসের দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ آلِ عِمۡرَانَ (3:9)', 'Dua of Certainty in the Day of Gathering', 'ईमान की मजबूती की दुआ', 'ایمان کی مضبوطی کی دعا', 'হে আমাদের পালনকর্তা! তুমি মানুষকে একদিন অবশ্যই একত্রিত করবেঃ এতে কোনই সন্দেহ নেই। নিশ্চয় আল্লাহ তাঁর ওয়াদার অন্যথা করেন না।', 'رَبَّنَآ إِنَّكَ جَامِعُ ٱلنَّاسِ لِيَوْمٍۢ لَّا رَيْبَ فِيهِ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يُخْلِفُ ٱلْمِيعَادَ', '"O our Sustainer! Verily, Thou wilt gather mankind together to witness the Day about [the coming of] which there is no doubt: verily, God never fails to fulfil His promise."', NULL, NULL, 'রাব্বানা ইন্নাকা জামি''উন নাসি লিয়াওমিল লা রাইবা ফীহি ইন্নাল্লাহা লা ইয়ুখলিফুল মী''আদ', 'Faith', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is faith, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, when heart feels weak and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for a steadfast heart upon faith | Surah Aal-i-Imraan 3:9", "search_intent": ["iman", "steadfast_heart", "truth"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-guidance-surah-aal-i-imraan-3-9", "focus_keywords": ["dua for a steadfast heart upon faith", "quranic dua for faith", "surah aal-i-imraan 3:9"], "difficulty_level": "medium", "meta_description": "Dua for a steadfast heart upon faith from Surah Aal-i-Imraan 3:9. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["faith", "iman", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u099a\u09c1\u09aa \u09a5\u09be\u0995\u09be\u09b0 \u09ad\u09c7\u09a4\u09b0\u09c7\u0993 \u0985\u09a8\u09c7\u0995 \u09a6\u09cb\u09df\u09be \u099c\u09ae\u09c7 \u09a5\u09be\u0995\u09c7\u0964 \u0988\u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a6\u09c3\u09a