('80ef38d1-ff76-4b16-9a9d-a8bd584cf360', 'dua', 'আইয়ুব (আ.)-এর দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ (21:83)', 'Dua of Ayyub in Illness and Affliction', 'सीरतुल मुस्तक़ीम की हिदायत की दुआ', 'شفا اور صحت یابی کی دعا', 'এবং স্মরণ করুন আইয়্যুবের কথা, যখন তিনি তাঁর পালনকর্তাকে আহবান করে বলেছিলেনঃ আমি দুঃখকষ্টে পতিত হয়েছি এবং আপনি দয়াবানদের চাইতেও সর্বশ্রেষ্ট দয়াবান।', '۞ وَأَيُّوبَ إِذْ نَادَىٰ رَبَّهُۥٓ أَنِّى مَسَّنِىَ ٱلضُّرُّ وَأَنتَ أَرْحَمُ ٱلرَّٰحِمِينَ', 'AND [remember] Job, when he cried out to his Sus­tainer, “Affliction has befallen me: but Thou art the most merciful of the merciful!”', NULL, NULL, 'ওয়াআইয়্যূবা ইয নাদা রাব্বাহূ আন্নী মাস্সানিয়াদ দুররু ওয়াআন্তা আরহামুর রাহিমীন', 'Healing', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is healing, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, daily reflection and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for relief in illness and affliction | Surah Al-Anbiyaa 21:83", "search_intent": ["reflection", "dua", "faith"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-guidance-surah-al-anbiyaa-21-83", "focus_keywords": ["dua for relief in illness and affliction", "quranic dua for healing", "surah al-anbiyaa 21:83"], "difficulty_level": "medium", "meta_description": "Dua for relief in illness and affliction from Surah Al-Anbiyaa 21:83. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["healing", "reflection", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u09b6\u09bf\u09ab\u09be\u09b0 \u099c\u09be\u09df\u0997\u09be\u09df \u0986\u099f\u0995\u09c7 \u0997\u09c7\u09b2\u09c7, \u09b6\u09bf\u09ab\u09be \u0993 \u0986\u09b0\u09cb\u0997\u09cd\u09af\u09c7\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be \u09ae\u09a8\u09c7 \u09aa\u09dc\u09