ence": "Surah Al-Araaf 7:47", "semantic_entities": ["Allah", "Guidance", "Clarity"], "when_to_recite_bn": "\u099a\u09bf\u09a8\u09cd\u09a4\u09be \u09a5\u09be\u09ae\u099b\u09c7 \u09a8\u09be \u09ae\u09a8\u09c7 \u09b9\u09b2\u09c7 \u09a8\u09bf\u0983\u09b6\u09ac\u09cd\u09a6\u09c7 \u09aa\u09dc\u09c1\u09a8\u0964", "when_to_recite_en": "Recite for your loved ones when you cannot help them in any other way.", "category_hierarchy": {"intent": "seeking_clarity", "primary": "Guidance", "secondary": "Direction"}, "recommendation_tags": ["after_salah", "before_decision", "daily_recitation", "seeking_clarity"], "recommended_moments": ["after_salah", "before_decision", "during_confusion"], "normalized_surah_names": ["Al-A''raf", "Al Araf", "Araf", "\u0627\u0644\u0623\u0639\u0631\u0627\u0641"]}'::jsonb, 'published', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, TRUE, '56f216af-a404-48b5-a081-66a30de79989', '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', 'Rabbanā lā tajʿalnā maʿal qawmi z-ālimīn', 'रब्बना ला ताजअालना माअाल क़ावमिज़ आलिमीन', 'رَبَّنَا لَا تَجْعَلْنَا مَعَ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ', 'dua-for-protection-surah-al-araaf-7-47', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('c1e50cdf-f09e-4bb6-a282-0f3c58cba8eb', 'dua', 'মূর্খতা থেকে আশ্রয় চাওয়ার দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ (2:67)', 'Dua of Musa — Refuge from Being Ignorant', 'हिफ़ाज़त और बुराई से पनाह की दुआ', 'حفاظت اور شر سے پناہ کی دعا', 'যখন মূসা (আঃ) স্বীয় সম্প্রদায়কে বললেনঃ আল্লাহ তোমাদের একটি গরু জবাই করতে বলেছেন। তারা বলল, তুমি কি আমাদের সাথে উপহাস করছ? মূসা (আঃ) বললেন, মূর্খদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হওয়া থেকে আমি আল্লাহর আশ্রয় প্রার্থনা করছি।', 'وَإِذْ قَالَ مُوسَىٰ لِقَوْمِهِۦٓ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَأْمُرُكُمْ أَن تَذْبَحُوا۟ بَقَرَةًۭ ۖ قَالُوٓا۟ أَتَتَّخِذُنَا هُزُوًۭا ۖ قَالَ أَعُوذُ بِٱللَّهِ أَنْ أَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلْجَٰهِلِينَ', 'AND LO! Moses said unto his people: "Behold, God bids you to sacrifice a cow." They said: "Dost thou mock at us?" He answered: "I seek refuge with God against being so ignorant!"', NULL, NULL, 'ওয়াইয কালা মূসা লিকাওমিহী ইন্নাল্লাহা ইয়া''মুরুকুম আন তাযবাহূ বাকারাতান কালূ আতাত্তাখিযুনা হুযুওয়ান কালা আ''ঊযু বিল্লাহি আন আকূনা মিনাল জাহিলীন', 'Protection', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is protection, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it morning adhkar, before sleep and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for protection from harm and evil | Surah Al-Baqara 2:67", "search_intent": ["protection", "safety", "evil_defense"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-protection-surah-al-baqara-2-67", "focus_keywords": ["dua for protection from harm and evil", "quranic dua for protection", "surah al-baqara 2:67"], "difficulty_level": "long", "meta_description": "Dua for protection from harm and evil from Surah Al-Baqara 2:67. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["protection", "protection", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "