ty", "primary": "Guidance", "secondary": "Direction"}, "recommendation_tags": ["after_salah", "before_decision", "daily_recitation", "seeking_clarity"], "recommended_moments": ["after_salah", "before_decision", "during_confusion"], "normalized_surah_names": ["An-Nas", "\u0627\u0644\u0646\u0627\u0633"]}'::jsonb, 'published', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, TRUE, '56f216af-a404-48b5-a081-66a30de79989', '2026-07-12T10:06:26.931+00:00', NULL, '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', '2026-07-12T10:05:51.621019+00:00', 'Malikin nās', 'मलिकिन नास', 'مَلِكِ ٱلنَّاسِ', 'dua-for-protection-surah-an-naas-114-2', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('f68b43d3-cbe1-4bd9-97d7-24bf351be6a8', 'dua', 'জান্নাতে ঘরের জন্য আসিয়ার দোয়া', 'دعاء من سورة سُورَةُ التَّحۡرِيمِ (66:11)', 'Dua of Asiya for a House in Paradise', 'आख़िरत में कामयाबी की दुआ', 'آخرت کی کامیابی کی دعا', 'আল্লাহ তা’আলা মুমিনদের জন্যে ফেরাউন-পত্নীর দৃষ্টান্ত বর্ণনা করেছেন। সে বললঃ হে আমার পালনকর্তা! আপনার সন্নিকটে জান্নাতে আমার জন্যে একটি গৃহ নির্মাণ করুন, আমাকে ফেরাউন ও তার দুস্কর্ম থেকে উদ্ধার করুন এবং আমাকে যালেম সম্প্রদায় থেকে মুক্তি দিন।', 'وَضَرَبَ ٱللَّهُ مَثَلًۭا لِّلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱمْرَأَتَ فِرْعَوْنَ إِذْ قَالَتْ رَبِّ ٱبْنِ لِى عِندَكَ بَيْتًۭا فِى ٱلْجَنَّةِ وَنَجِّنِى مِن فِرْعَوْنَ وَعَمَلِهِۦ وَنَجِّنِى مِنَ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ', 'And for those who have attained to faith God has propounded a parable in [the story of] Pharaoh''s wife as she prayed "O my Sustainer! Build Thou for me a mansion in the paradise [that is] with Thee, and save me from Pharaoh and his doings, and save me, from all evildoing folk!', NULL, NULL, 'ওয়াদারাবাল্লাহু মাসালাল লিল্লাযীনা আমানুমরাআতা ফির''আওনা ইয কালাত রাব্বিবনি লী ইনদাকা বাইতান ফিল জান্নাতি ওয়ানাজ্জিনী মিন ফির''আওনা ওয়া''আমালিহী ওয়ানাজ্জিনী মিনাল কাওমিয যালিমীন', 'Hereafter', NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, 0, '{"faq": [{"a": "Its primary focus is hereafter, asked from Allah with humility and trust.", "q": "What is the main meaning of this dua?"}, {"a": "Recite it after salah, night reflection and whenever this need is present in your life.", "q": "When is it best to recite this dua?"}, {"a": "Read it with understanding of meaning, a soft heart, and sincere intention.", "q": "How should this dua be read?"}], "seo": {"meta_title": "Dua for success in the Hereafter | Surah At-Tahrim 66:11", "search_intent": ["akhirah", "judgment_day", "paradise"], "canonical_slug": "dua-for-protection-surah-at-tahrim-66-11", "focus_keywords": ["dua for success in the hereafter", "quranic dua for hereafter", "surah at-tahrim 66:11"], "difficulty_level": "long", "meta_description": "Dua for success in the Hereafter from Surah At-Tahrim 66:11. Understand the meaning and recite with sincerity.", "semantic_keywords": ["hereafter", "akhirah", "quranic supplication", "dua meaning"]}, "hook": "\u09ad\u09c7\u09a4\u09b0\u09c7 \u099f\u09be\u09a8\u09be\u09aa\u09cb\u09dc\u09c7\u09a8 \u099a\u09b2\u09b2\u09c7 \u09b6\u09ac\u09cd\u09a6 \u0995\u09ae\u09c7 \u09af\u09be\u09df\u0964 \u09b6\u09c7\u09b7 \u09aa\u09b0\u09bf\u09a3\u09a4\u09bf \u09a8\u09bf\u09df\u09c7 \u098f\u099f\u09be \u09aa\u09dc\u09b2\u09c7 \u09ae\u09a8\u09c7 \u09b9\u09df, \u0986\u09ae\u09bf \u098f\u0995\u09be \u09a8\u09be\u0964", "social": {"short": "\u099a\u09be\u09aa\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ae\u09df\u09c7 \u09aa\u09dc\u09be\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09df\u09be \u2022 66:11 \u098f\u0987\u099f\u09c1\u0995\u09c1\u0987 \u09af\u09a5\u09c7\u09b7\u09cd\u099f \u09b9\u09a4\u09c7 \u09aa\u09be\u09b0\u09c7\u0964", "facebook": "\u0986\u0996\u09bf\u09b0\u09be\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ab\u09b2\u09a4\u09be\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be (Surah At-Tahrim 66:11) \u2014 \u09ad\u09bf\u09a4\u09b0\u09c7 \u099a\u09be\u09aa \u09a5\u09be\u0995\u09b2\u09c7 \u09ae\u09be\u09a8\u09c1\u09b7 \u099a\u09c1\u09aa \u09b9\u09df\u09c7 \u09af\u09be\u09df; \u098f\u0987 \u09a6\u09cb\u09df\u09be \u09a4\u0996\u09a8 \u0995\u09a5\u09be \u09ac\u09b2\u09c7\u0964", "whatsapp": "\u0986\u0996\u09bf\u09b0\u09be\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u09b8\u09ab\u09b2\u09a4\u09be\u09b0 \u09a6\u09cb\u09af\u09bc\u09be (Surah At-Tahrim 66:11). \u099a\u09be\u0987\u09b2\u09c7 \u09a8\u09be\u09ae\u09be\u099c\u09c7\u09b0 \u09aa\u09b0 \u09aa\u09dc\u09a4\u09c7 \u09aa\u09be\u09b0\u09c7\u09a8\u0964"}, "source": "Quran", "virtue": "Sincere reliance on Allah brings protection and tranquility to the heart.", "emotion": ["peace", "protection", "trust"], "benefits": ["\u09b9\u09be\u09b2\u09be\u09b2 \u099c\u09c0\u09ac\u09bf\u0995\u09be \u0993 \u09ac\u09b0\u0995\u09a4\u09c7\u09b0 \u099c\u09a8\u09cd\u09af \u09ae\u09a8\u0995\u09c7 \u09aa\u09b0\u09bf\u09b7\u09cd\u0995\u09be\u09b0 \u09a8\u09bf\u09df\u09a4\u09c7 \u09b0\u